  "instructions": [
    "heat a tablespoon of oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "add the onion and cook until it's translucent.",
    "add the ginger and garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "add the cumin, coriander, turmeric, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 30 seconds, stirring constantly.",
    "add the dashi extract and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "reduce the heat to low and add the parma ham, letting it cook for 2-3 minutes or until it's heated through.",
    "stir in the fresh cilantro and serve hot."
  ],
